"""Publish precise full-public versus held-out-split coverage terminology."""
import hashlib,json
from pathlib import Path
HERE=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
def main():
    z=json.loads((HERE/'public_benchmark_coverage.json').read_text());assert z['status']=='passed' and z['auditor_sha256']==hashlib.sha256((HERE/'audit_public_benchmark_coverage.py').read_bytes()).hexdigest()
    for lang in ['en','zh']:
        text=('# Public benchmark coverage and exact evaluation scope\n\n' if lang=='en' else '# 公开基准覆盖范围与实际评价口径\n\n')
        text+=('## RxQA: the entire public OpenFDA component\n\nThe official release contains **300 OpenFDA questions**, all of which are used for transfer. They are not a sampled subset of the publicly released component. The BNF-derived questions are not publicly released because of licensing restrictions and are not evaluated here. [Official release and scope](https://github.com/Google-Health/rxqa).\n\n' if lang=='en' else '## RxQA：公开OpenFDA部分全部300题\n\n官方公开的是 **300道OpenFDA题目**，迁移实验覆盖全部300题，没有从这份公开文件中抽样。BNF来源题目因许可限制未公开，本项目没有评测这部分。[官方发布与范围说明](https://github.com/Google-Health/rxqa)。\n\n')
        text+=('A fresh independent audit verifies the pinned CSV hash, 300 unique question IDs, the complete transfer membership, original option order and every answer label. It also recounts all four matched v17 methods from saved per-question predictions:\n\n' if lang=='en' else '本次独立核验检查固定CSV哈希、300个唯一题号、完整迁移成员、原选项顺序及每道题标签；并逐题复算v17四种匹配方法的保存预测：\n\n')
        text+='| Method | Correct / all public questions | Accuracy |\n|---|---:|---:|\n'
        for method,r in z['v17_complete_public_rxqa_predictions'].items():text+=f"| {method} | {r['correct']}/{r['n']} | {100*r['correct']/r['n']:.2f}% |\n"
        text+=('\nThese are existing results, independently recounted here. Skill evolution does not improve transfer in this comparison. The historical v3 direct prompt scores186/300; it is a different prompt/budget snapshot and is not substituted for the matched CoT row.\n\n' if lang=='en' else '\n这里是对已有结果的独立复算，不是新跑出的提升；技能进化在这组迁移对照中没有获益。历史v3直接提示为186/300，属于不同提示／预算的快照，不能替换本表匹配的CoT对照。\n\n')
        text+=('## RxSafeBench: raw release, deduplication and evolution split\n\nThe pinned two source files contain **2,443 records**, consistent with the official release description. Deduplication by task type, exact dialogue and correct drug yields **2,000 derived three-option cases**. Historical direct/reconsideration/light-review runs cover all 2,000 cases. This conversion is different from the original medication-generation evaluation; its scores cannot be compared numerically with the official leaderboard. [Official benchmark](https://github.com/CAS-SIAT-XinHai/RxSafeBench).\n\n' if lang=='en' else '## RxSafeBench：原始发布、去重与进化划分\n\n固定的两个源文件共 **2,443条记录**，与官方说明一致；按任务类型、完全相同对话及正确药物去重后，得到 **2,000道三选一衍生题**。历史直接回答／重新考虑／轻量复核覆盖全部2,000题。该任务转换与原论文的药物生成评价不同，不能同官方排行榜数值直接排名。[官方基准](https://github.com/CAS-SIAT-XinHai/RxSafeBench)。\n\n')
        text+='| Historical fixed method | Correct / unique cases | Accuracy | Fixes / regressions vs direct |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n'
        for method,r in z['rxsafebench']['full_deduplicated_historical_predictions'].items():
            pair=f"{r['fixes']} / {r['regressions']}" if 'fixes' in r else 'reference';text+=f"| {method} | {r['correct']}/{r['n']} | {100*r['correct']/r['n']:.2f}% | {pair} |\n"
        text+=('\nLater adaptive experiments partition these same 2,000 cases into625 training,190 proposal,197 guard and988 test cases, with no question/scenario-group overlap. Those methods are compared on the **same988 test cases**; reporting all2,000 as their held-out test would include adaptation data. The historical full-set table and the later frozen-test table therefore remain separate.\n\n' if lang=='en' else '\n后续进化实验将同一2,000题划为625训练、190 proposal、197 guard、988测试，题目及场景组不跨划分。进化方法统一比较 **同一988道测试题**；不能把参与进化的数据也算作未见测试。因此，历史全量表与后续冻结测试表分别报告。\n\n')
        text+=('## Metadata correction and audit limits\n\nThe archived v3 full-harness report retained a stale “30+30” sample description. Actual source identities and all saved predictions independently verify **2,000 cases per method**. The archived report is preserved; this document and its audit record correct the description. The English manuscript now names RxQA as the complete public OpenFDA component. No scores or original predictions are changed.\n\nThis audit verifies coverage, conversion and saved-answer counting. It does not establish clinical safety, official benchmark equivalence or a new method improvement.\n\n' if lang=='en' else '## 元数据修正与核验局限\n\n历史v3完整harness报告的样本说明误沿用了“30+30”，但源身份与保存预测逐项核验均证实 **每方法2,000题**。原始报告保留，本说明与核验记录修正其文字；英文论文也改为明确称RxQA公开OpenFDA部分全量。分数和原始预测没有变化。\n\n本核验确认覆盖范围、转换和保存答案计数，不证明临床安全、与官方原任务等价，或新方法取得提升。\n\n')
        text+='[Coverage audit and hashes](public_benchmark_coverage.json) · [Current public method comparison](../upgrade_v17/RESULTS.en.md)\n'
        (HERE/f'PUBLIC_BENCHMARKS.{lang}.md').write_text(text)
if __name__=='__main__':main()
